  "limitations": "This material was prepared through commercial cooperation with the seller Premium Gifts; all nine entries belong to its assortment. It is not an independent study of the whole market or a comparative product test. The selection and order follow the agreed S04 scenario: nine families and 16 eligible offers, with one confirmed footrest configuration selected from each family. The order is based on commercial popularity within the original assortment: units delivered from 20 November 2025 to 19 November 2026 were multiplied by the dealer price, then aggregated by family. The data snapshot is dated 19 November 2026; later returns are not included. This indicator does not measure ergonomics, durability or quality. The final two families have the same zero value and retain the scenario order. Names, configurations, links and photographs were checked against the product workbook and original listings on 27 November 2026. Nine photographs show the specific products; the generated cover illustrates a workstation and does not depict a claimed model."
